Subject: [PATCH] feat(phase3): admin theme - sidebar, topbar, components,
 animations, dashboard
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Đổi font sang Be Vietnam Pro (hỗ trợ tiếng Việt)
- Viết lại _Layout.cshtml: sidebar thu gọn + topbar + breadcrumb + dark/light mode
- Tạo admin-components.css: stat card, data table, floating form, toast, badges, skeleton
- Tạo admin-animations.css: fade-in, stagger, hover-lift, ripple, scroll reveal, prefers-reduced-motion
- Tạo admin-ui.js: sidebar toggle, count-up, scroll reveal, ERP.confirm(), ERP.toast()
- Cập nhật Dashboard (Index.cshtml) sử dụng component class mới
- Viết docs/UI-GUIDE.md: bảng màu, quy ước class, component usage

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EqW8ZVjYPXQ2Jwe9Tm1Wqg
